title: Polish Red Autumn
new-page: true
go-to: poland_legacy_event_desk if started = 1 and poland_legacy_event_phase = 1; poland_event_queue if started = 1 and poland_event_phase = 1; poland_hub if started = 1 and poland_event_phase != 1 and poland_legacy_event_phase != 1; start_menu if started = 0

@start_menu
new-page: true

= Polish Red Autumn

**Poland, October 2019.** After four years outside parliament, Zjednoczona
Lewica returns as a tense alliance: SLD's machine, Wiosna's progressives,
Razem's organisers and trade-union social democrats.

Keep that alliance intact through the presidential election, COVID-19,
constitutional conflict, the border crisis, war and the July 2023
election-readiness reckoning. Then survive the 2023 transfer of power and the
coalition crises through 2026 before facing the 2027 parliamentary election.

- @campaign_game: Begin the October 2019 campaign
- @formation_game: Play the 2023 transfer of power
- @modinfo: About Polish Red Autumn
- @poland_credits: Credits and provenance

@start_menu_2
go-to: start_menu

